<title>FINLAND: INGMAN SWINGS TO FIM 22 MLN PROFIT IN '96.</title>
<headline>INGMAN SWINGS TO FIM 22 MLN PROFIT IN '96.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to January 2,</p>
<p>1997,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items			  22.0 vs 1.9 loss</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		  18.05 vs 2.89 loss</p>
<p> Net sales					1,031.0 vs 995.6</p>
<p> Operating profit				  37.4 vs 5.6</p>
<p> Operating profit before depreciation	76.8 vs 40.2</p>
<p> Depreciation					39.4 vs 34.6</p>
<p> Net financial items		    charge 15.4 vs 7.5 charge</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes	 22.9 vs 32.7</p>
<p> Net profit					   6.8 vs 14.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish dairy group is Ingman Foods Oy Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 6805 0245</p>
